#. type: Title #
#: docs/sap/transport.md:1 docs/sap/transport.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "SAP Transport"
msgstr "SAP 传输"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:8
msgid ""
"FreeAnima uses a **two-layer** wire model on a single WebSocket endpoint:"
msgstr "FreeAnima 在单一 WebSocket 端点上使用**两层**线路模型："

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:11
msgid ""
"**Habitat RPC** (`HubRPC/1.0`) — transport connect, auth, heartbeat, generic "
"`req`/`res`/`evt`."
msgstr ""
"**Habitat RPC**（`HubRPC/1.0`）— 传输层 connect、认证、心跳及通用 `req`/`res`/"
"`evt`。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:11
msgid ""
"**SAP** (`SAP/1.0`) — optional `sap.attach` / `sap.detach` session for true "
"satellite processes."
msgstr ""
"**SAP**（`SAP/1.0`）— 可选的 `sap.attach` / `sap.detach` 会话，供真正的 "
"satellite 进程使用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:13
msgid ""
"Bundled SPA clients use layer 1 only. See [hub-rpc.md](hub-rpc.md) for "
"transport details."
msgstr ""
"壳内 bundled SPA 客户端仅使用第 1 层。传输细节见 [hub-rpc.md](hub-rpc.md)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/transport.md:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "端点"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/sap/transport.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "ws://{hub_host}:{port}/rpc/v1\n"
msgstr "ws://{hub_host}:{port}/rpc/v1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:21
msgid ""
"Derive from Habitat HTTP URL: replace `http` with `ws`, strip trailing slash, "
"append `/rpc/v1`. Default Habitat port: **2658**."
msgstr ""
"由 Habitat HTTP URL 推导：将 `http` 替换为 `ws`，去掉末尾斜杠，追加 `/hub/rpc/"
"v1`。Habitat 默认端口：**2658**。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:23
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Implemented in [`platform/src/sap/bun-route.ts`](../../platform/src/sap/"
#| "bun-route.ts). Client helpers: `@freeanima/hub-rpc` "
#| "(`resolveHabitatRpcWsUrl`) and `@freeanima/sap-contract/urls` (re-exports)."
msgid ""
"Implemented in [`src/platform/sap/bun-route.ts`](../../src/platform/sap/bun-"
"route.ts). Client helpers: `@freeanima/hub-rpc` (`resolveHabitatRpcWsUrl`) and "
"`@freeanima/sap-contract/urls` (re-exports)."
msgstr ""
"实现位于 [`platform/src/sap/bun-route.ts`](../../platform/src/sap/bun-"
"route.ts)。客户端辅助：`@freeanima/hub-rpc`（`resolveHabitatRpcWsUrl`）与 "
"`@freeanima/sap-contract/urls`（再导出）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/transport.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Envelope kinds"
msgstr "信封类型"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:27
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Habitat RPC envelopes live in [`packages/hub-rpc/src/protocol.ts`](../../"
#| "packages/hub-rpc/src/protocol.ts). SAP re-exports them from [`packages/"
#| "sap-contract/src/protocol.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/"
#| "protocol.ts)."
msgid ""
"Habitat RPC envelopes live in [`src/shared/hub-rpc/protocol.ts`](../../src/"
"shared/hub-rpc/protocol.ts). SAP re-exports them from [`src/shared/sap-"
"contract/protocol.ts`](../../src/shared/sap-contract/protocol.ts)."
msgstr ""
"Habitat RPC 信封位于 [`packages/hub-rpc/src/protocol.ts`](../../packages/hub-rpc/"
"src/protocol.ts)。SAP 从 [`packages/sap-contract/src/protocol.ts`](../../"
"packages/sap-contract/src/protocol.ts) 再导出。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `kind`      | Layer   | Purpose                                                                   |\n"
"| ----------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `connect`   | Habitat RPC | `protocol: HubRPC/1.0`, `auth_token`                                      |\n"
"| `connected` | Habitat RPC | `session_id`, `heartbeat_interval_sec`                                    |\n"
"| `req`       | Both    | RPC (`id`, `method`, `payload`) — incl. `sap.attach`, `conversation.*`, … |\n"
"| `res`       | Both    | RPC response                                                              |\n"
"| `evt`       | Both    | Async event                                                               |\n"
msgstr ""
"| `kind`      | 层      | 用途                                                                      |\n"
"| ----------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `connect`   | Habitat RPC | `protocol: HubRPC/1.0`、`auth_token`                                      |\n"
"| `connected` | Habitat RPC | `session_id`、`heartbeat_interval_sec`                                    |\n"
"| `req`       | 双层    | RPC（`id`、`method`、`payload`）— 含 `sap.attach`、`conversation.*` 等    |\n"
"| `res`       | 双层    | RPC 响应                                                                  |\n"
"| `evt`       | 双层    | 异步事件                                                                  |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:37
msgid "Invalid JSON or schema → WebSocket close **1003** (`invalid frame`)."
msgstr "无效 JSON 或 schema → WebSocket 关闭 **1003**（`invalid frame`）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/transport.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection state machine"
msgstr "连接状态机"

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/transport.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"stateDiagram-v2\n"
"  [*] --> Disconnected\n"
"  Disconnected --> RpcConnected: connect accepted\n"
"  RpcConnected --> SapAttached: sap.attach ok\n"
"  RpcConnected --> RpcConnected: bundled req/res\n"
"  SapAttached --> SapAttached: satellite req/res\n"
"  SapAttached --> RpcConnected: sap.detach\n"
"  RpcConnected --> Disconnected: close\n"
msgstr ""
"stateDiagram-v2\n"
"  [*] --> Disconnected\n"
"  Disconnected --> RpcConnected: connect accepted\n"
"  RpcConnected --> SapAttached: sap.attach ok\n"
"  RpcConnected --> RpcConnected: bundled req/res\n"
"  SapAttached --> SapAttached: satellite req/res\n"
"  SapAttached --> RpcConnected: sap.detach\n"
"  RpcConnected --> Disconnected: close\n"

