#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/transport.md:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "Heartbeat"
msgstr "心跳"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:96
msgid ""
"Client sends `evt { method: \"heartbeat\" }` on `heartbeat_interval_sec`. "
"Habitat replies with `evt { method: \"heartbeat\", payload: { ts } }`."
msgstr ""
"客户端按 `heartbeat_interval_sec` 发送 `evt { method: \"heartbeat\" }`。Habitat "
"以 `evt { method: \"heartbeat\", payload: { ts } }` 回复。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:98
msgid "`runHubRpcTransport` starts the heartbeat timer after connect."
msgstr "`runHubRpcTransport` 在 connect 后启动心跳定时器。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:103
msgid ""
"**Bundled SPA:** `getBundledHabitatRpcClient()` / `runHubRpcTransport` with "
"backoff."
msgstr ""
"**壳内 bundled SPA：** `getBundledHabitatRpcClient()` / `runHubRpcTransport`（含"
"退避）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:103
msgid ""
"**Satellites:** `createSatelliteHub()` reconnects transport and re-attaches "
"SAP session."
msgstr ""
"**Satellite：** `createSatelliteHub()` 重连传输层并重新 attach SAP 会话。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:105
msgid ""
"On detach or disconnect, Habitat calls `onSapDetach` and unregisters tools for "
"that instance."
msgstr "detach 或断开时，Habitat 调用 `onSapDetach` 并注销该实例的工具。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/transport.md:106
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Local SAP relay (pair-programming)"
msgid "Local SAP relay (optional)"
msgstr "本地 SAP relay（pair-programming）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:109
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Pair-programming exposes `ws://{satellite_host}:{port}/sap/relay/v1` for "
#| "browser UI. The satellite **process** holds the Habitat `/rpc/v1` "
#| "connection and SAP attach; relay clients send `req`/`res`/`evt` without "
#| "transport or SAP handshakes."
msgid ""
"Some Type B satellites may expose `ws://{satellite_host}:{port}/sap/relay/"
"v1` for browser UI. The satellite **process** holds the Habitat `/rpc/v1` "
"connection and SAP attach; relay clients send `req`/`res`/`evt` without "
"transport or SAP handshakes."
msgstr ""
"pair-programming 为浏览器 UI 暴露 `ws://{satellite_host}:{port}/sap/relay/"
"v1`。satellite **进程**持有 Habitat `/rpc/v1` 连接并完成 SAP attach；relay 客"
"户端发送 `req`/`res`/`evt`，无需传输层或 SAP 握手。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Event         | Direction           | Meaning                            |\n"
"| ------------- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n"
"| `relay.ready` | Satellite → browser | Relay attached; safe to send `req` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 事件          | 方向                | 含义                               |\n"
"| ------------- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n"
"| `relay.ready` | Satellite → browser | Relay 已 attach；可安全发送 `req`  |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:115
msgid ""
"Use `createSapRelayClient` / `createSapRelayBrowserClient` from `@freeanima/"
"sap-contract`."
msgstr ""
"使用 `@freeanima/sap-contract` 中的 `createSapRelayClient` / "
"`createSapRelayBrowserClient`。"

